[statement]
The walk takes a name's candidates in order of priority: `pb`, of higher
priority though listed second, is walked first, so `q2`, which it lists
first, is decided before `q1`, and `c2` answers both.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v

P:pa
V:1
p:v
k:10
D:q1 q2

P:pb
V:1
p:v
k:100
D:q2 q1

P:c1
V:1
p:q1
k:100

P:c2
V:1
p:q1 q2=1
k:10


[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install c2 1
install pb 1
install app 1
